-165w7gf alchemy-rte"><span style="width:100%"><p>Health Benefits</p></span></div><div data-rid="1d1020b4-50f4-4f76-bdc5-a47644d67ec9" class="r-lvrxij" aria-hidden="true"><svg stroke="currentColor" fill="currentColor" stroke-width="0" viewBox="0 0 16 16" role="img" aria-label="Collapse/Expand" style="width:var(--rsw, 100%);height:auto;max-height:100%" class="r-btnkhb" height="1em" width="1em" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg"><path d="M8 4a.5.5 0 0 1 .5.5v3h3a.5.5 0 0 1 0 1h-3v3a.5.5 0 0 1-1 0v-3h-3a.5.5 0 0 1 0-1h3v-3A.5.5 0 0 1 8 4"></path></svg></div></div><div hidden="" id="replo-:R1nlsb2:"><div data-rid="6df6eac3-8f17-40b9-9b0a-a1721b3b54a8" class="r-sdvw5v"><div data-rid="cc0279f0-edb1-427f-9712-61a556ef1d69" class="r-15h0pna alchemy-rte"><span style="width:100%"><p>You’ll experience a full body reset in just a few days by drinking cold-pressed vegetable juice and fruit juice blends that are packed with vitamins, minerals, enzymes, antioxidants, and anti-inflammatory plant compounds.</p><p>The Skinny Cleanse®:</p><p>• Supports healthy weight loss and weight management.</p><p>• Detoxifies your body.</p><p>• Helps you burn body fat.</p><p>• Improves gut health and lessens bloating.</p><p>• Eliminates unhealthy cravings...especially for sugar.</p><p>• Increases energy levels naturally.</p><p>• Boosts your immune system and reduces inflammation.</p><p>Every sip is functional. Every bottle is nutritionist-designed to target specific health benefits and wellness goals.</p></span></div></div></div></div><div data-rid="df8262c2-fc66-40a8-96ca-c002efe51e69" class="r-1baguts" data-replo-collapsible="true" data-state="closed" data-orientation="vertical"><div data-rid="a5f9a91f-f2c3-4c2e-b423-b2fdc24ef6f4" aria-expanded="false" aria-controls="replo-:R27lsb2:" tabindex="0" role="button" class="r-1tf5qwo"><div data-rid="b649dbfd-d481-454f-abfe-63ad6ae00476" class="r-lrj8m5 alchemy-rte"><span style="width:100%"><p>A Typical Day on a Juice Cleanse</p></span></div><div data-rid="1a2fed47-5c37-47e9-be0f-5efd06d51c7e" class="r-i8rfs5" aria-hidden="true"><svg stroke="currentColor" fill="currentColor" stroke-width="0" viewBox="0 0 16 16" role="img" aria-label="Collapse/Expand" style="width:var(--rsw, 100%);height:auto;max-height:100%" class="r-1f5eoa4" height="1em" width="1em" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg"><path d="M8 4a.5.5 0 0 1 .5.5v3h3a.5.5 0 0 1 0 1h-3v3a.5.5 0 0 1-1 0v-3h-3a.5.5 0 0 1 0-1h3v-3A.5.5 0 0 1 8 4"></path></svg></div></div><div hidden="" id="replo-:R27lsb2:"><div data-rid="3ffd4442-a6b3-404b-9573-3386f810cfe1" class="r-1juj9q9"><div data-rid="0a96f656-f9c7-4573-925f-cbf53c8f184a" class="r-bzs1l4 alchemy-rte"><span style="width:100%"><p>You’ll receive 6 juices for each day of your Skinny Cleanse. We recommend starting around 8am and drinking one bottle at least every 2 hours, finishing the last juice at 6pm.&nbsp;</p><p>Wake up & drink a large glass of water, have your coffee (if desired), and some fresh fruit.</p><p>8am: Sweet Greens - for daily detox</p><p>10am: Citrus Carrot - for stronger immunity</p><p>12 noon: Tarte Greens - for better gut health</p><p>2pm: Sweet Roots - for increased energy</p><p>4pm: Sweet Greens - for daily detox</p><p>6pm: Cool Greens - for better digestion/less bloating</p><p>This order of juices above is recommended, but you will still experience the same benefits regardless of the order in which you drink each flavor. If you wait too long between juices, you can run the risk of becoming too hungry.</p><p><br></p><p><strong>EATING</strong></p><p>Eat as much fresh fruit and vegetables as you desire throughout each day- either with your juices or in between. This includes baked, dry-roasted, or steamed potatoes. Instead of using oil or fats like butter on the potatoes, you can use lemon juice, salt, pepper, or any other fresh herbs and spices you like.&nbsp;</p><p>Your Cleanse Guide includes a complete list of cleanse-approved foods and a recipe for a Hearty Vegetable Soup that you can enjoy without restriction during your cleanse.</p><p><br></p><p><strong>COFFEE</strong></p><p>We recommend that you drink your coffee either black or with a low fat plant-milk like oatmilk. If you want to sweeten it, use honey. Adding sugar and creamer will defeat the purpose of doing a juice cleanse.&nbsp;</p><p><br></p><p><strong>DRINKING WATER</strong></p><p>Even though these healthy juices are very hydrating, we strongly recommend drinking water throughout the day, ideally one glass between every bottle of juice. Water helps your body to flush out toxins more efficiently.</p><p><br></p><p><strong>EXERCISE</strong></p><p>This cleanse doesn’t provide enough calories to sustain intense workouts.&nbsp; Even if you eat extra calories, it is best to limit your physical activities to walking, stretching, gentle yoga, and core work.&nbsp;</p><p><br></p><p><strong>SLEEP</strong></p><p>Sleep is just as important to weight loss as what you eat. Your body will release more weight if you get good sleep. We recommend at least 7-9 hours each night.</p></span></div></div></div></div></div><div data-rid="681af499-a6d5-488b-88cb-f84ed5baacec" class="r-1901chd"><div data-rid="244fa107-7011-4e88-9ed8-f73afd6361fa" class="r-1c12gu0"><picture data-rid="89f34f80-8fb8-468b-9cad-c0fd45fcc2e2" class="r-1irnfji"><source srcSet="https://assets.replocdn.com/projects/d4cd737f-4038-4ccc-bf23-4e278ca1f47d/74ae170b-6034-475e-b1c7-20bc5ffb56ff?width=136" media="(max-width: 640px)"/><source srcSet="https://assets.replocdn.com/projects/d4cd737f-4038-4ccc-bf23-4e278ca1f47d/74ae170b-6034-475e-b1c7-20bc5ffb56ff?width=150" media="(min-width: 641px) and (max-width: 1024px)"/><source srcSet="https://assets.replocdn.com/projects/d4cd737f-4038-4ccc-bf23-4e278ca1f47d/74ae170b-6034-475e-b1c7-20bc5ffb56ff?width=150" media="(min-width: 1025px) and (max-width: 2400px)"/><img src="https://assets.replocdn.com/projects/d4cd737f-4038-4ccc-bf23-4e278ca1f47d/74ae170b-6034-475e-b1c7-20bc5ffb56ff" class="r-1esuzwj" loading="